# The first window: two overlapping windows, a focus change by a click, a drag, typing into a field and a close.
desk-scenario 1
screen 640 480
depths 8 4
open notes 60 60 300 180 "Notes"
label notes 12 12 "The first window."
open welcome 220 150 340 200 "Welcome to Desk"
label welcome 12 12 "Type something:"
field welcome 12 36 300
pointer 320 240
frame open
# Moving the pointer repaints nothing: two 12 x 19 cursor rectangles, widened to 8-pixel columns at depth 4.
move 100 60
frame moved
expect-damage 8 456 2
expect-damage 4 608 2
# A click on Notes' title bar focuses and raises it.
pointer 120 70
press left
release left
frame focus
# A drag of its title bar moves it by (40, 30).
press left
move 40 30
release left
frame dragged
# A click in Welcome's content focuses it again, and the field takes the typing.
pointer 400 300
press left
release left
type "desk"
frame typed
# A click on Welcome's close box closes it and focuses Notes.
pointer 543 161
press left
release left
frame closed
